-     own process (call activity prepare-decision); only `preparation` comes back. Diagram (bpmndi)
-     generated with bpmn-auto-layout. -->
+<!-- Bake-off: purchase.bpmn with the owner's change (test 1): over 5,000, the CFO approves after
